team/apps/3076200/extras/e3ed0c8ac4e6746bea91fceda4cc0f85.mp4?t=1753201433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to challenge you and progress the story while still being fun and fair (no pixel hunting or moon logic).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076200/extras/24eb9b5d5e0b897b92f0ae5a428a47b5.poster.avif?t=1753201433\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076200/extras/24eb9b5d5e0b897b92f0ae5a428a47b5.webm?t=1753201433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076200/extras/24eb9b5d5e0b897b92f0ae5a428a47b5.mp4?t=1753201433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>INVENTORY (PUZZLES)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you will discover items that will help you solve puzzles and overcome obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items you can take a closer look at, while others you can combine to craft a unique item.</p>",
    "short_description": "Ashwood Conspiracy is a story-rich point-and-click adventure game. Follow in your late uncle's footsteps to uncover the mystery behind the most devastating event in Ashwood's history. Find, collect, and combine items to solve puzzles and overcome obstacles. Will you dare to finish what he started?",
